{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13708","headline":"严公钓台作 · 顾况","name":"严公钓台作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵芝产遐方，威凤家重宵。\n严生何耿洁，托志肩夷巢。\n汉后虽则贵，子陵不知高。\n糠粃当世道，长揖夔龙朝。\n扫门彼何人，升降不同朝。\n舍舟遂长往，山谷多清飙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}